:26.180"><span begin="00:24.320" end="00:24.800">What </span><span begin="00:24.800" end="00:25.010">I </span><span begin="00:25.010" end="00:25.250">will </span><span begin="00:25.250" end="00:26.030">tell </span><span begin="00:26.030" end="00:26.030">（</span><span begin="00:26.030" end="00:26.150">tell</span><span begin="00:26.150" end="00:26.180">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:26.180" end="00:29.300"><span begin="00:26.180" end="00:26.540">Happened </span><span begin="00:26.540" end="00:26.840">just </span><span begin="00:26.840" end="00:27.230">the </span><span begin="00:27.230" end="00:27.740">other </span><span begin="00:27.740" end="00:28.130">day </span><span begin="00:28.130" end="00:28.130">（</span><span begin="00:28.130" end="00:28.490">day</span><span begin="00:28.490" end="00:29.300">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.300" end="00:31.220"><span begin="00:29.300" end="00:29.570">I </span><span begin="00:29.570" end="00:29.930">must </span><span begin="00:29.930" end="00:30.920">confess </span><span begin="00:30.920" end="00:30.950">（</span><span begin="00:30.950" end="00:31.220">confess</span><span begin="00:31.220" end="00:31.220">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:31.220" end="00:34.130"><span begin="00:31.220" end="00:31.340">'Cos </span><span begin="00:31.340" end="00:31.430">I've </span><span begin="00:31.430" end="00:31.850">had </span><span begin="00:31.850" end="00:32.450">about </span><span begin="00:32.450" end="00:33.020">enough </span><span begin="00:33.020" end="00:33.020">（</span><span begin="00:33.020" end="00:34.070">enough</span><span begin="00:34.070" end="00:34.130">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:34.130" end="00:35.990"><span begin="00:34.130" end="00:34.520">I </span><span begin="00:34.520" end="00:34.850">need </span><span begin="00:34.850" end="00:35.090">your </span><span begin="00:35.090" end="00:35.780">help </span><span begin="00:35.780" end="00:35.780">（</span><span begin="00:35.780" end="00:35.960">help</span><span begin="00:35.960" end="00:35.990">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.990" end="00:38.780"><span begin="00:35.990" end="00:36.260">Got </span><span begin="00:36.260" end="00:36.350">to </span><span begin="00:36.350" end="00:36.650">make </span><span begin="00:36.650" end="00:36.950">this </span><span begin="00:36.950" end="00:37.220">here </span><span begin="00:37.220" end="00:37.520">thing </span><span begin="00:37.520" end="00:38.480">stop </span><span begin="00:38.480" end="00:38.480">（</span><span begin="00:38.480" end="00:38.780">stop</span><span begin="00:38.780" end="00:38.780">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.780" end="00:43.490"><span begin="00:38.780" end="00:39.380">Baby </span><span begin="00:39.380" end="00:39.590">I </span><span begin="00:39.590" end="00:40.700">swear </span><span begin="00:40.700" end="00:40.790">I </span><span begin="00:40.790" end="00:41.420">tell </span><span begin="00:41.420" end="00:41.930">the </span><span begin="00:41.930" end="00:43.370">truth </span><span begin="00:43.370" end="00:43.370">（</span><span begin="00:43.370" end="00:43.490">uhuh</span><span begin="00:43.490" end="00:43.490">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.490" end="00:48.410"><span begin="00:43.490" end="00:44.090">About </span><span begin="00:44.090" end="00:44.330">all </span><span begin="00:44.330" end="00:44.480">the </span><span begin="00:44.480" end="00:45.530">things </span><span begin="00:45.530" end="00:45.710">you </span><span begin="00:45.710" end="00:46.430">used </span><span begin="00:46.430" end="00:46.970">to </span><span begin="00:46.970" end="00:47.450">do </span><span begin="00:47.450" end="00:47.450">.</span><span begin="00:47.450" end="00:47.480">e </span><span begin="00:47.480" end="00:47.870">on</span><span begin="00:47.870" end="00:48.410">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:48.410" end="00:53.240"><span begin="00:48.410" end="00:48.950">And </span><span begin="00:48.950" end="00:49.220">i