nd="01:02.630">the </span><span begin="01:02.630" end="01:02.960">lie </span><span begin="01:02.960" end="01:03.140">that </span><span begin="01:03.140" end="01:03.500">you </span><span begin="01:03.500" end="01:04.250">denied</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:04.250" end="01:06.620"><span begin="01:04.250" end="01:04.490">All </span><span begin="01:04.490" end="01:05.930">rise </span><span begin="01:05.930" end="01:06.020">（</span><span begin="01:06.020" end="01:06.080">all </span><span begin="01:06.080" end="01:06.530">rise</span><span begin="01:06.530" end="01:06.620">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:06.620" end="01:09.260"><span begin="01:06.620" end="01:06.920">All </span><span begin="01:06.920" end="01:07.640">rise </span><span begin="01:07.640" end="01:07.640">（</span><span begin="01:07.640" end="01:07.730">all </span><span begin="01:07.730" end="01:08.420">rise</span><span begin="01:08.420" end="01:08.480">, </span><span begin="01:08.480" end="01:08.540">all </span><span begin="01:08.540" end="01:09.050">rise</span><span begin="01:09.050" end="01:09.260">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:09.260" end="01:11.600"><span begin="01:09.260" end="01:09.650">Three </span><span begin="01:09.650" end="01:09.830">for </span><span begin="01:09.830" end="01:09.950">the </span><span begin="01:09.950" end="01:10.370">calls </span><span begin="01:10.370" end="01:10.460">you've </span><span begin="01:10.460" end="01:10.790">been </span><span begin="01:10.790" end="01:11.600">making</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="01:11.600" end="01:14.030"><span begin="01:11.600" end="01:11.810">It's </span><span begin="01:11.810" end="01:12.170">four </span><span begin="01:12.170" end="01:12.290">for </span><span begin="01:12.290" end="01:12.410">the </span><span begin="01:12.410" end="01:12.800">times </span><span begin="01:12.800" end="01:12.920">you've </span><span begin="01:12.920" end="01:13.280">been </span><span begin="01:13.280" end="01:14.030">faking</span></p><